      "q": "How much does Booz Allen Hamilton make from federal contracts?",
      "a": "Booz Allen Hamilton obligated $4.3B in federal contracts in FY2026 to date. The company received 838 awards for a current-year average award size of $5.2M, and obligations fell 34.2% year over year. Historical obligations include $6.6B in FY25 and $7.1B in FY24."
    },
    {
      "q": "Which agencies buy from Booz Allen Hamilton?",
